{"title":"2004 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The average of the five numbers in a list is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/c/b1cb5bdce2d06d2419066a2b55ab01d824217bd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$54$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" />. The average of the first two\nnumbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/f/5afbad0b221f0ef70186fe70b08e6fc1efdd8dfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$48$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. What is the average of the last three numbers?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/5/b05e935c185f4ace8e5768163f0fc7bb8fcd104c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 55 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 56 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 57 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 58 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 59$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/c/42c06de735d79f0b28c30bcbbcf96e67bb1ca42c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c, d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3a59bb1293ee3f6dec19de4019a7178874219ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/6/446c743355622397b61142e7293f2b0e916b8383.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a+b+c+d+e}{5}=54$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"178\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/7/b371817b99d44c8582fe29fa810d08302617b409.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c+d+e=270$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"183\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/7/527bc51a266aec1d2ea409987b132258b14430f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a+b}{2}=48$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"85\" height=\"37\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/8/208b826440d22d8bc01835e809767fb99619abfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=96$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"14\" />. Substituting back into our original equation, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/6/ae61f21cbf82020352af774883919f2b73cd9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$96+c+d+e=270$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"164\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/5/4059401a4db059927896575fc001d5ada7fd04cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c+d+e=174$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"121\" height=\"14\" />. Dividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> gives the average of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/3/963401af2f269e8e830eb54344dcc17c99b4acdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 58}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8\" title=\"2004 AMC 8\">2004 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2004\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2004 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/w